cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "dsh-cu-benchmark: real-time GUI benchmark for DeepSeek Harness + dsh-real-time-computer-use"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible evaluation harness that measures how well an LLM agent drives a real Windows
  desktop (mouse, keyboard, screen reading) on 69 real-time browser GUI tasks, with a hard
  tool-surface restriction, environment-derived success criteria, an independent trajectory audit,
  and per-frame capture-timing verification.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "1azybug"
repository-code: "https://github.com/1azybug/dsh-cu-benchmark"
version: "2026-09-25"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - computer use
  - GUI agent
  - real-time benchmark
  - DeepSeek Harness
